---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PhotoSlot from '../components/PhotoSlot.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Sage & Spur Ranch" description="Learn the values and approach behind Sage & Spur Ranch.">
  <header class="page-intro"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About Sage & Spur</span><h1>Rooted in the work. Open to what comes next.</h1><p class="lead">Sage & Spur Ranch honors Western heritage through responsible horsemanship, practical care, and a welcome that is earned through action.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our story</span><h2>A legacy with room to grow.</h2><p>Every ranch carries a story. Ours begins with a belief that courage is built in the everyday: tending what is entrusted to us, learning from the land, and showing up with respect.</p><p><strong>[Confirm]</strong> Add the ranch’s verified history, founder names, exact location, and operating details here before public launch.</p></div><PhotoSlot tall label="Sage & Spur Ranch landscape" /></div></section>
  <section class="section paper-deep"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">What guides us</span><h2>Values you can see in the work.</h2></div><ul class="rule-list"><li><span>01</span>Put animal welfare and safety first.</li><li><span>02</span>Share skills with humility and clarity.</li><li><span>03</span>Care for the land and the people who gather on it.</li></ul></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
